155 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 124 0 R/T(MOSHI IS AN EXPRESSIVE ROBOTIC COMPANION DESIGNED TO EXPLORE EMOTIONAL INTERACTION BETWEEN HUMANS AND MACHINES THROUGH MOVEMENT, BEHAVIOR, AND DIGITAL EXPRESSION. THE PROJECT REINTERPRETS AN OPEN-SOURCE QUADRUPED ROBOTIC PLATFORM INTO A DESIGN-LED INTERACTIVE EXPERIENCE FOCUSED ON COMPANIONSHIP, PLAYFULNESS, AND APPROACHABLE TECHNOLOGY.)/E(MOSHI IS AN EXPRESSIVE ROBOTIC COMPANION DESIGNED TO EXPLORE EMOTIONAL INTERACTION BETWEEN HUMANS AND MACHINES THROUGH MOVEMENT, BEHAVIOR, AND DIGITAL EXPRESSION. THE PROJECT REINTERPRETS AN OPEN-SOURCE QUADRUPED ROBOTIC PLATFORM INTO A DESIGN-LED INTERACTIVE EXPERIENCE FOCUSED ON COMPANIONSHIP, PLAYFULNESS, AND APPROACHABLE TECHNOLOGY.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

156 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 124 0 R/T(RATHER THAN TREATING ROBOTICS PURELY AS A MECHANICAL OR ENGINEERING CHALLENGE, MOSHI INVESTIGATES HOW MOVEMENT, PERSONALITY, VISUAL LANGUAGE, AND RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR CAN CREATE EMOTIONAL ENGAGEMENT IN EVERYDAY ENVIRONMENTS.)/E(RATHER THAN TREATING ROBOTICS PURELY AS A MECHANICAL OR ENGINEERING CHALLENGE, MOSHI INVESTIGATES HOW MOVEMENT, PERSONALITY, VISUAL LANGUAGE, AND RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR CAN CREATE EMOTIONAL ENGAGEMENT IN EVERYDAY ENVIRONMENTS.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

