386 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 146 0 R/E(Moshi\220s electronics system is built around an ESP32 microcontroller that controls movement, emotional behaviors, WiFi connectivity, and real-time interaction. The robot uses an 8-servo articulation system for expressive quadruped motion and an OLED display for animated facial expressions. A custom captive portal interface allows wireless control of emotions and directional movement through a browser-based dashboard.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[61]>>
endobj

387 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 146 0 R/T(MOSHI EXPLORES A FUTURE WHERE ROBOTICS BECOME EMOTIONALLY ENGAGING EVERYDAY COMPANIONS.)/E(MOSHI EXPLORES A FUTURE WHERE ROBOTICS BECOME EMOTIONALLY ENGAGING EVERYDAY COMPANIONS.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[62]>>
endobj

388 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 146 0 R/E(Moshi is a quadruped companion robot that combines embedded systems, expressive interaction, and wireless control within a compact modular platform. Built using an ESP32 microcontroller, servo-based locomotion, and an OLED facial display, Moshi uses a custom captive portal interface to enable real-time emotional expression and directional movement through a browser-based interaction system.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[63]>>
endobj

389 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 146 0 R/T(CURRENT MARKET OPPORTUNITIES OF MOSHI)/E(CURRENT MARKET OPPORTUNITIES OF MOSHI)/Pg 33 0 R/K[64]>>
endobj

390 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 146 0 R/E(The growing interest in companion robotics, emotional AI, and interactive consumer technology creates strong opportunities for systems like Moshi. With increasing demand for educational robots, therapeutic companions, desk assistants, and emotionally engaging AI products, Moshi explores how expressive robotics can evolve beyond functionality into approachable, human-centered everyday experiences.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[65]>>
endobj

